            "description_html": "<b>\"GE\" Style Pivot for Aluminum or Hollow Metal Doors</b>\r\n<p>\r\nReplacement for Jackson 20-944 'GE' center hung bottom pivot hinge set. Global Door Controls GE Pivot sets are designed for use with aluminum framed storefront doors or properly prepared wood and hollow metal doors up to 125 pounds. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GE-pivot_size.gif?v=1704354747\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Jackson 20-944 GE pivot size\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPivot bearing mounts to door threshold. Bearing bracket attaches to bottom of door (Door Rail).\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n For Threshold Application - 1-9/16\" (38mm) Deep Bottom Rail\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>For Center Hung Doors up to 125 Lbs.</li>\r\n<li>Height Adjustable</li>\r\n<li>Full Ball Bearing Design</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GE-pivot.pdf?v=1704262225\" target=\"new\"><b>Jackson 20-944 \"GE\" Pivot Dimensional  Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged complete with bearing, bearing bracket, mounting anchors and screws.\r\n</p>",
